cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Web Citing: a browser extension for citing web pages"
abstract: >-
  A browser extension that reads the current page's public citation metadata and
  turns it into a reference record importable by reference managers (RIS,
  EndNote, BibTeX, CSL-JSON) as well as a formatted citation in GB/T 7714-2015,
  APA 7th, MLA 9th, Chicago and Harvard. All parsing happens locally; the
  extension makes no network requests.
authors:
  - family-names: Bai
    given-names: Xuqian
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-10
repository-code: https://github.com/Er-White/Web-Citing
keywords:
  - citation
  - reference management
  - browser extension
  - RIS
  - EndNote
  - BibTeX
  - GB/T 7714
